Great.

00:01:09.299 --> 00:01:11.990
It is a lot of data and there is a lot of
interesting stuff there.

00:01:11.990 --> 00:01:15.579
But it is a lot of data that can be really
hard to search, which is not so great.

00:01:15.579 --> 00:01:18.889
When there is that much data you need a way
