00:03:38.700 --> 00:03:43.660
The Amazon Registry of open data is a listing
of publicly available data sets and it is

00:03:43.660 --> 00:03:47.720
a way to search and find data that has been
made available for general use.

00:03:47.720 --> 00:03:54.620
And SRA has had a set of COVID focused data
