00:03:58.300 --> 00:03:59.940
This brings a number of benefits.

00:03:59.940 --> 00:04:05.610
It allows you to access a large volume of
Covid-19 read data at full cloud speed and

00:04:05.610 --> 00:04:07.500
no cost to you.

00:04:07.500 --> 00:04:12.190
In addition, let you analyze the data, in
