00:07:03.529 --> 00:07:05.059
and have used it before.

00:07:05.059 --> 00:07:11.360
The aligned read objects as I'm about to show,
we set up metadata in Athena that lets you

00:07:11.360 --> 00:07:17.710
do specific searches on submitted and calculated
metadata to help you find the ones, the specific

00:07:17.710 --> 00:07:20.120
contigs or reads that are most interesting
