cloud?

00:28:10.780 --> 00:28:16.030
[Jonathan Trow] I am not sure about that.

00:28:16.030 --> 00:28:17.300
Here in Athena you mean?

00:28:17.300 --> 00:28:21.510
[Peter Cooper] The person asked the question
if they could clarify exactly what you want

00:28:21.510 --> 00:28:22.510
to know.

00:28:22.510 --> 00:28:27.850
Part of the question is whether we have all
the data at all I think.

00:28:27.850 --> 00:28:35.370
The GISAID is the flu resource collecting
the SARS-CoV-2 data.

00:28:35.370 --> 00:28:40.650
[Jonathan Trow] It's not available in the
tables currently.

00:28:40.650 --> 00:28:46.060
It may be available at NCBI, I'm not 100%
