00:28:46.060 --> 00:28:48.960
We can certainly get an answer for that.

00:28:48.960 --> 00:28:51.190
[Peter Cooper] Another question.

00:28:51.190 --> 00:28:55.070
For nanopore sequence reads, is the raw instrument
